        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "A rare severe genetic arrhythmogenic disorder of the structurally normal heart characterized by catecholamine-induced ventricular tachycardia (VT) manifesting as syncope and sudden death in young individuals."
        },
